# Core patches (ledger-template/core-patches/*.patch) are applied with `git apply` to sources that
# have LF line endings. The repository root's `*.patch text eol=crlf` would check them out with CRLF
# endings, and a CRLF patch no longer applies to an LF file, so every build that lists one would stop
# with exit 20. Keep them LF on every platform.
*.patch text eol=lf
